1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,578
Two lab habits examiners love.

2
00:00:02,578 --> 00:00:11,315
Choose R so that the balance point lands near the middle, between forty and sixty centimetres, because that is where the error is smallest.

3
00:00:11,315 --> 00:00:15,221
Then swap X and R, take the reading again, and average.

4
00:00:15,221 --> 00:00:20,286
That cancels the small extra resistance of the copper strips at the ends.

